P2_AUDIT_DECL {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"ImbalancedChen.Certificates.PairedFibreIntegral","name":"ImbalancedChen.Certificates.pairedFibreIntegral_eq_iterated","readable_type":"∀ {a Z : ℝ},\n  LT.lt.{0} 0 a →\n    LE.le.{0} a Z →\n      Eq.{1}\n        (∫ (z : ℝ) in a..Z,\n          HMul.hMul.{0, 0, 0} (HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} 1 (HPow.hPow.{0, 0, 0} z 2))\n            (∫ (w : ℝ) in a..z, HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} 1 w))\n        (ImbalancedChen.Certificates.pairedFibreIntegral a Z)","type":"∀ {a Z : Real}\n  (ha : @LT.lt.{0} Real Real.instLT (@OfNat.ofNat.{0} Real (nat_lit 0) (@Zero.toOfNat0.{0} Real Real.instZero)) a)\n  (hAZ : @LE.le.{0} Real Real.instLE a Z),\n  @Eq.{1} Real\n    (@intervalIntegral.{0} Real Real.normedAddCommGroup\n      (@InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace.{0, 0} Real Real Real.instRCLike\n        (@NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup.{0} Real Real.normedAddCommGroup)\n        (@RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal.{0} Real Real.instRCLike))\n      (fun (z : Real) =>\n        @HMul.hMul.{0, 0, 0} Real Real Real (@instHMul.{0} Real Real.instMul)\n          (@HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} Real Real Real (@instHDiv.{0} Real (@DivInvMonoid.toDiv.{0} Real Real.instDivInvMonoid))\n            (@OfNat.ofNat.{0} Real (nat_lit 1) (@One.toOfNat1.{0} Real Real.instOne))\n            (@HPow.hPow.{0, 0, 0} Real Nat Real\n              (@instHPow.{0, 0} Real Nat (@NPow.toPow.{0} Real (@Monoid.toNPow.{0} Real Real.instMonoid))) z\n              (@OfNat.ofNat.{0} Nat (nat_lit 2) (instOfNatNat (nat_lit 2)))))\n          (@intervalIntegral.{0} Real Real.normedAddCommGroup\n            (@InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace.{0, 0} Real Real Real.instRCLike\n              (@NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup.{0} Real Real.normedAddCommGroup)\n              (@RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal.{0} Real Real.instRCLike))\n            (fun (w : Real) =>\n              @HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} Real Real Real\n                (@instHDiv.{0} Re